ecomment-2908342859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106741","id":2908342859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tWcpL","user":{"login":"DarcyWalker","id":175914659,"node_id":"U_kgDOCnw-ow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175914659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker","html_url":"https://github.com/DarcyWalker","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DarcyWalker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T02:31:54Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T02:32:29Z","body":"> I assume it should be solved by [#104269](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104269). Please check latest master if you can.\n> \n> Or it could simply be the wrong Callback mode for Skeleton like [#87888 (comment)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87888#issuecomment-2144234890), so check to see if that is correct as well.\n\nI tried the recent beta, it doesn't solve my issue.\n\n> > I can't share the project I'm working on.\n> \n> This still needs a minimal project, or we can't really test anything, so please try to create a minimal project, if you are unable to share your resources please try to find free resources to use like from the official demos\n\nI found that if the physics interpolation is disabled while the skeleton node's callback mode is set to idle, the IK updates instantly, but I need the interpolation because the physics has to run at 60 frames.\nHere's a demo project, sorry I took so long, I got locked out of my github and my email accounts at the same time for some reason, it took me days to log back in to both of those.\n\n[ik-lag-example.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20434124/ik-lag-example.zip)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2908342859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2908417785","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106741#issuecomment-2908417785","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106741","id":2908417785,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tWu75","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-26T03:31:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-26T03:54:44Z","body":"I found the cause after looking at the MRP: the BoneAttachment is updated after all Skeleton modifications are updated, but the IK is processed before the BoneAttachment is updated.\n\nMaybe BoneAttachment needs an option to connect to SkeletonPreUpdate (or after processing any AnimationMixer and SkeletonModifier), I remember discussing with @lyuma earlier about BoneAttachment for IK targets.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2908417785/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]